Subject: [PATCH] 4126: an admin route queues the registration research for one
 fictional seat
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The tester (box 60032): seats made by the admin route never pass through
sign-up, so the registration research run (D757 §5, ON since 12 Oct) could not
be tested. POST /admin/test-accounts/:id/registration-research { note } queues
that same run for one fictional seat, once; a real person's account is refused
(403) before anything is written, as every seat route refuses.

